// The Appendix B world (docs/probe/RULES.md): the SSRN Appendix B flow economy on the
// engine, run by the four Appendix B roles, for the Phase 2 probe (PROBE-SPEC,
// 2026-09-26).
//
// Generated: do not edit. `cargo run -p rustyecon-probe --bin appb-tape -- <path>` writes
// it, and the test `appb_tape_is_its_generators_output` checks this file against the
// generator.
//
// Genesis is the oracle's equilibrium (PROBE-SPEC §4.6, mode A): crates/oracle (unit 1a,
// P1.1) solved at the instance's per-tick values, N = 4.0 and T = 10.0 at 52 ticks a
// year, and b = 0.4, gives
//   x* = 0.863150418162437, 1 - x* = 0.136849581837563,
//   v = w/r = 0.5434359606967785, p_m/r = 0.6102454257640557, p/r = 0.36157583177980934,
//   P_s/r = 1.3615758317798092, Y = 7.880605524972908, K = 5.298486187567731, N_a = 1.3433818800977175.
// The genesis prices are those ratios with r = 1 coin. The good desk holds Y of the good
// and the machine desk K of machine services, one tick's output each, and the good desk's
// human share 1 - x is 1 - x*. Each actor's coin is its stationary balance under the
// dials, with share(v) = 1 - exp(-v/52) (Clock::share; docs/probe/RULES.md §4):
//   desk.good  p*Y/share(buffer.desk.good.cash)               = 29.94282457255491
//   desk.mach  (lam*w + b*r)*K/share(buffer.desk.mach.cash)   = 23.78417887464776
//   provider   N*P_s + (r*T - N*P_s)/share(spend.provider)    = 26.03270836105176
//   workers    (N*P_s + w*N*F)/share(spend.workers)           = 27.922094099033625
//              with F = ln1p(w/P_s)/chi_max, the share of hours offered.
// No agent reads the oracle at run time (R13): it seeds genesis here and scores runs in
// the harness (crates/probe), outside the Sim.
Tape(
    schema: 1,
    header: (
        name: "appb",
        start: "1750-01-01",
        ticks_per_year: 52,
        market: (rule: Imbalance, one_sided: Saturate, ema_time_constant: "price.ema_tc"),
        ledger: (rel_flow: "ledger.rel_flow", rel_stock: "ledger.rel_stock"),
